      "widgets_values": [
        "# Director-Studio · Qwen Actor Workbench (current logic)\n\n## Data flow\n1. **Actor ref** → Master portrait (keep identity: face / hair / body)\n2. **Optional wardrobe** → re-dress only; lock master body / hair\n3. **Three-view multipanel once**  \n   image1 = master · image2 = actor ref  \n   Output: front | 3/4 | back (2880×1920)\n4. **Bust** = top crop of three-view (no second sample)\n5. **Asset sheet** = bust + fullbody concat\n\n## Notes\n- No separate body/hair text tracks\n- No per-view re-sampling (avoids multi-person backs)\n- Production uses DS backend API; this graph is for visualization / manual debug\n"
      ],
      "title": "DS Actor · How to use"
    },
